---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="New group"><div class="page"><header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start a shared space</p><h1>Create a group.</h1><p>For a home, a trip, a team, or anything you share.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/dashboard">Cancel</a></header><div class="form-layout"><form class="panel form-card" method="POST" action="/api/groups/create"><label>Group name<input name="name" required placeholder="e.g. Maple House" /></label><label>What is this group for? <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">(optional)</span><input name="description" placeholder="e.g. Shared household expenses" /></label><button class="button" type="submit">Create group →</button></form><aside class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2>Keep the first version simple.</h2><p class="auth-muted">OweEasy starts every group with equal splits. You can add members, record costs, and see exactly how every balance was calculated.</p></aside></div></div></Layout>
